title: Tutorial
---
 
->look around
	RD-T5: There is a red door and a blue door. You can ask me to inspect the doors by using the <command>INSPECT</command> command, say something like INSPECT Red Door.
	<info>Command <command>INSPECT</command> now unlocked</info>
->inspect red door
	It's a locked red door
	<<jump Tutorial>>
->inspect blue door
	<<jump Office>>
